  "description": {
    "text": "Given to players at the Unified Minds prerelease tournaments on the weekends of 20–21 and 27–28 July 2019, and sold in shops from 16 August 2019. Each box held four Unified Minds booster packs and a 23-card Evolution pack built around one of four promos with the Unified Minds logo. The packs also held a non-holo Froslass, a card that is holofoil in booster packs.",
